// A twelve-bar study in E minor pentatonic, written for Riff Buddy.
// Original material, released with the app under its own terms; nothing here is
// transcribed from a recording. Two tracks so mute, solo and volume have
// something to act on, and twelve bars so a loop over bars 5-8 sits in the
// middle rather than at an edge.
\title "Pentatonic Study"
\subtitle "E minor, two tracks"
\artist "Riff Buddy"
\tempo 96
.
